# Row 43 (2026-10-15 operator directive): UAT artifacts are per-run evidence,
# never in the repo (screenshots, manifests, verdict docs under date dirs).
# Fixture-class evidence (e.g. tests/evidence/row-40/) is a different thing
# and stays tracked.
tests/evidence/uat-snapshots/
# Fork model (2026-11-24 migration plan, section 5): the serve tree's CNAME
# never rides in the tracked tree. A branch deployment reads the served
# directory's CNAME file as its custom domain, so a tracked file would make
# Pages claim its hostname the moment it serves main. The cutover PR
# commits the CNAME deliberately with www.protectsouthportland.org.
docs/CNAME
